---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Terms of use for the Kuroaxe website."
  path="/terms"
>
  <article class="shell max-w-3xl py-10 lg:py-14">
    <p class="kicker">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 text-5xl sm:text-6xl">Terms</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-bone">
      <p>
        This website presents Kuroaxe’s work and invitations to enquire. Case studies, metrics, and client names
        marked as representative or placeholder are illustrative of standard, not a guarantee of future results.
      </p>
      <p>
        All design, copy, and stills on this site are owned by Kuroaxe or used with permission. Do not reproduce
        them without written consent.
      </p>
      <p>
        Engagements are governed by a separate agreement. Nothing on these pages constitutes an offer to contract
        until both parties sign.
      </p>
      <p>
        Placeholder terms for launch. Replace with counsel-reviewed language before public commercial use.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
